# DUSKLING X4, BACKWATER (room 40): the backwater, the one warp pocket that sends you back (to the weed maze).
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 40
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 26
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 19
wait 2
expect room == 8
